# Normalize line endings.
#
# The repo previously held a mix of CRLF and LF, which turned small edits into
# whole-file diffs whenever a tool rewrote a file with the other ending.
# text=auto stores every text file with LF in the repository; eol=lf checks it
# out with LF too, so the working tree matches on every platform.
* text=auto eol=lf

# Binary assets must never be line-ending converted.
*.png binary
*.jpg binary
*.jpeg binary
*.gif binary
*.ico binary
*.webp binary
*.mp4 binary
*.woff binary
*.woff2 binary
*.ttf binary
*.eot binary
*.otf binary
